<title>USA: Maine $15 mln housing bonds yield 6.25 pct in 2018.</title>
<headline>Maine $15 mln housing bonds yield 6.25 pct in 2018.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
